{
  "about": "The English messages the Air move introduced (src/core/i18n/en.ts, air.*), each with sample values. test/unit/i18n/moved-strings.test.ts asserts that the French catalog renders what the rewrite layer made of the English; `written` is French the layer does not make (a text the legacy panel never drew as one message, or one it left in English), `fr` the values French writes differently. #234 deleted the map entries the legacy panel no longer renders: `was` is what the layer made of the English before, `after` what it makes of it now. The entries another screen still renders (the level words, No data, No purifiers, Close, Manual, Fan, Outside, Comfortable, the pollen levels, the history words, Open air quality details, Air) or that the patterns of the layer shared stay. Deleted with the layer in phase 4.",
